# Agenpic's own per-project scaffold (CLI + local credential) — written by
# scaffold.rs if this repo is ever opened as a project inside Agenpic
# itself. Every managed project gets this line auto-appended to its own
# .gitignore already (see ensure_gitignored in scaffold.rs); this repo just
# doesn't have one of its own to auto-append to at rest.
.agenpic/

# Claude Code local runtime state
.claude/scheduled_tasks.lock

# Locally installed Claude Code skills (npx skills add) — the actual files
# land in .agents/, symlinked from .claude/skills/ using absolute,
# machine-specific paths. Personal tooling, not app source.
.agents/
.claude/skills/

